M. J. Kochenderfer, T. A. Wheeler, and K. H. Wray, <em id="bib.bib2.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Algorithms for decision making</em>. MIT press, 2022.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib3" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_bibitem">[3]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
T. Badings, T. D. Simao, M. Suilen, and N. Jansen, “Decision-making under uncertainty: beyond probabilities: Challenges and perspectives,” <em id="bib.bib3.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">International Journal on Software Tools for Technology Transfer</em>, vol. 25, no. 3, pp. 375–391, 2023.

</span></li>
      
